d eddie to blackmail  the alien into releasing anne and  merging with him again by that point  anne is fully healed but she's horrified  by her actions as she venom especially  once eddie reveals that the symbiote  can't actually force a person to act  against their will disgusted by both the  symbiote and what it's revealed about  herself and shuns eddie for making the  alien suit bond with her in the first  place despite this in the series final  issue anne briefly becomes she venom  once again to rescue eddie from a sticky  situation  despite her mixed feelings toward her  ex-husband and his symbiote friend ann  wang isn't interested in getting eddie  brock arrested unfortunately she still  ends up being forced to cooperate with  the police when they attempt to capture  her ex in 1996's venom along came a  spider and gives eddie a subtle heads up  when he tries to call her leading  eddie's symbiote to travel through her  phone receiver and temporarily turn anne  into she-venom once again this time  however the symbiote remains partially  attached to eddie leading to a euphoric  experience in which eddie and ann  experience each other's memories venom  rescues anne from police headquarters  but she is eventually arrested for  acting as his accomplice teddy's  symbiote travels to anne by telephone  once more this time bonding with her  fully she venom proceeds to go to thrill  world in the hopes of meeting eddie but  she finds it's become a hideout for  crime boss ld50 and his associates a  showdown between she venom ben reilly's  spider-man the police and ld50s gang  breaks out during which anne gives eddie  the symbiote to heal him from injuries  but not before getting her fair share of  punches and kicks not to mention green  slobber inn as she venom after ld50's  defeat eddie admits he still loves anne  who states she'd only consider letting  him back into her life if he put his  hatred for spider-man and reliance on  symbiotes behind him  since her debut anne 