assed away her  legacy lives on in a sun with eddie  brock's dna that the symbiote  impregnated her with during one of her  stints as she-venom  are you serious believing she won't be  able to raise the child due to her  growing paranoia over the symbiote and  forces herself to leave her apartment  and give the baby to her father-in-law  carl brock in 2019's venom number 12.  though anne vows she'll return for her  son she dies before she can make good on  her promise leading carl to raise him as  his own neither ann nor carl tells eddie  about the boy eddie doesn't manage to  meet him until he arrives wounded and  mind-controlled by the venom symbiote at  his father's home dylan and eddie are  initially completely ignorant of their  true connection nor are they aware that  anne unknowingly transferred the piece  of the venom symbiote still in her genes  to dylan granting him unique powers  eventually however they learn the truth  and eddie begins taking care of his long  lost son  ann wang and eddie brock are two very  different people yet for some reason the  venom symbiote seems to like merging  with anne almost as much as it likes  bonding with eddie brock an answer of  sorts to this confounding riddle is  finally given in 2020's venom the end  which asserts that ann wang is one of  the universe's most suitable beings for  bonding with the symbiote outside of  eddie brock not only that her  compatibility is right on par with that  of telcar a warrior from the cree empire  who served as the venom symbiote's first  host long before the alien suit ever met  ann wang or eddie brock unlike telkar  however who had to rely on scientific  enhancement to bond with the symbiote  and's high compatibility level is  completely natural it's never exactly  explained why anne meshes so well with  the symbiote although it might be  because as venom sinner takes all shows  she can be just as bloodthirsty as eddie  when pushed  in one alternate reality ann wang  becomes she-venom 